    "title": "Chase Elliott to make rare NASCAR Truck start at North Wilkesboro - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nick DeGroot ,\n10 hours ago Spire Motorsports announced that Chase Elliott will drive the No. 7 Chevrolet Silverado at North Wilkesboro, making his first start in the NASCAR Craftsman Truck Series since the 2023 season-opener at Daytona. HendrickCars.com will sponsor the effort. This race was scheduled to be one of Kyle Busch's 2026 Truck appearances... Read full article",
